# m3_loop: m3_boss's input for 2000 ticks: after the 120-tick breather the table restarts
# (phase 0) and stage 2 enemies spawn again (the 8 s beetle spawns at ~1670 with HP 5 and the sweep kills it by ~1697).
--frames 2000 --call-at "31 debug_god" --call-at "32 debug_warp" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_stage,debug_phase,debug_enemies --at "1300 debug_phase == 0" --at "1690 debug_enemies > 0" --expect "debug_stage == 1" --expect "debug_state == 1"
